          "message": {
            "text": "Paths mode no longer pre-pins raster emoji before Blink-equivalent fallback. The captured image rectangle owns visual paint, while the shared shaped fallback owns face selection, clusters, and advances; this removes the only kFirstCandidateForNotdefGlyph exception between render modes.",
            "markdown": "Paths mode no longer pre-pins raster emoji before Blink-equivalent fallback. The captured image rectangle owns visual paint, while the shared shaped fallback owns face selection, clusters, and advances; this removes the only kFirstCandidateForNotdefGlyph exception between render modes."
