          "message": {
            "text": "A segmented webfont face remains part of the author-selected primary family even when it is not the exact pre-instanced Font object. Blink walks all contributing CSSSegmentedFontFace declarations; keeping family-primary identity separate from object reuse preserves author variation/features on every partition and prevents embedded instances at distinct axes from collapsing.",
            "markdown": "A segmented webfont face remains part of the author-selected primary family even when it is not the exact pre-instanced Font object. Blink walks all contributing CSSSegmentedFontFace declarations; keeping family-primary identity separate from object reuse preserves author variation/features on every partition and prevents embedded instances at distinct axes from collapsing."
          },
          "locations": [
